{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2020-12-14 08:30:00', 'title': 'INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE LAUNCHES 10 NEW MSCI® INDEX FUTURES', 'text': 'ATLANTA & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING OPERATOR OF GLOBAL EXCHANGES AND CLEARING HOUSES AND PROVIDER OF MORTGAGE TECHNOLOGY, DATA AND LISTINGS SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF FUTURES ON AN ADDITIONAL 10 MSCI INDICES. FOUR OF THE MSCI INDICES HELP MARKET PARTICIPANTS BETTER UNDERSTAND THE OPPORTUNITIES AND RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH CLIMATE CHANGE AND TRANSITIONING TO A LOW CARBON ECONOMY. THESE NEW CARBON- AND CLIMATE-FOCUSED INDEX FUTURES'}